 To solve this disruptive incident, Danmaku battles are completely unhinged and fighters are allowed to use even their most powerful attacks!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Danmaku and Grazing</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/852c36b2179bec74f2f991f76ce83c91.poster.avif?t=1734254202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/852c36b2179bec74f2f991f76ce83c91.webm?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/852c36b2179bec74f2f991f76ce83c91.mp4?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Gensokyo, Bullets are a means of communication to resolve conflict. Every Fighter is equipped with some form of projectiles. As such, interactions such as approaching, controlling space and pursuing is typically dominated by bullets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/aa66002bbd9b65db30f844a2a400fb3d.poster.avif?t=1734254202\" width=620 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/aa66002bbd9b65db30f844a2a400fb3d.webm?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/aa66002bbd9b65db30f844a2a400fb3d.mp4?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, just as important is dodging these bullets. Whenever a fighter grazes any attack, their Spell meter fills up. With Spell meter, Fighters gain access to their strong attacks. If completely filled however, fighters can unleash a Spellcard!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellcard System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas