?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/924c17416a750714d59591044f98169d.mp4?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And unleash your annihilation of love!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ability Cards</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/5a909ff806a05b736dbcc7fb1050dbe6.poster.avif?t=1734254202\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/5a909ff806a05b736dbcc7fb1050dbe6.webm?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/extras/5a909ff806a05b736dbcc7fb1050dbe6.mp4?t=1734254202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ability cards makes a return with effects much more convincing than its previous appearance! Summon the various powers of familiar faces across Gensokyo to aid you in your quest for victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rollback-Network Planned<br></li><li>7 Playable Fighters</li></ul>More to be announced in the future...","developers":["Tight Stuffs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290860/header.jpg?t=1734254202","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Touhou Project belongs to Team Shanghai Alice \u00a9\u4e0a\u6d77\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u5e7b\u6a02\u56e3","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2290860/531348/f7dc8d8ac0a855112306085706084f75f22c4009/1750980464/dash_av1.mpd?t=1675436154","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2290860/531348/f7dc8